+//! Radix: the kernel of Dukovo, with mlibc as its C library.
+//!
+//! * mlibc: <https://github.com/managarm/mlibc>, built with its Radix system
+//!   layer and Linux's ABI headers (`abi-bits`), so most numbers and
+//!   layouts here are Linux's on x86-64. The thread, spawn and semaphore
+//!   types are mlibc's own.
+//!
+//! The constants are generated from mlibc's headers, and Dukovo's build
+//! of the standard library (`ports/rust-std`) compares every type's size
+//! and alignment, every field's offset and every constant's value here
+//! with the C headers'.
+
+use crate::prelude::*;
